editor_description = "Story 4-3 (AC 4, ruling 4-3/R17). The unit's BODY shape, sized to the existing grey box (0.6 x 1.2 x 0.6) and offset +0.6 in y for the same reason the Mesh is: the unit ROOT is at the box's FEET (the runner spawns units at y 0), unlike the hero root which is its body CENTRE. NO layer/mask lines, exactly like hero.tscn's HeroActor root - both bodies sit on default layer 1 'bodies', which is what makes a unit block a hero (and another unit) without a new layer and without touching project.godot. This is the WHOLE collision mechanism: there is deliberately NO hurtbox and NO Area3D on this scene - a unit takes no damage until 4-3a ships one."

